sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CALLER as Caller (anywhere)
    participant ENTRY as fentry program
    participant FN as vfs_read body
    participant EXIT as fexit program
    participant MAP as starts map<br/>(hash, tid → ts)
    participant RB as ringbuf

    CALLER->>ENTRY: vfs_read(file, buf, n)
    Note over ENTRY: trampoline calls<br/>fentry first
    ENTRY->>MAP: insert tid, ktime_get_ns()
    ENTRY-->>FN: continue to body
    FN->>FN: read bytes...<br/>(may take µs to ms)
    FN-->>EXIT: ret = bytes_read
    Note over EXIT: trampoline calls fexit<br/>with args + return value
    EXIT->>MAP: lookup tid, get ts
    EXIT->>MAP: delete tid
    EXIT->>RB: emit(dur, ret, comm)
    EXIT-->>CALLER: return to caller
